{"id":"competencia","lemma":"competencia","pos":"noun","rank":1725,"glosses":["competence, expertise","jurisdiction, purview","competition"],"ipa":"/kompeˈtenθja/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"competencias"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4c/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-competencia.wav","examples":[{"text":"La competencia te hace mejor.","en":"Competition makes you better.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/526850","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"better"}]},{"text":"Sus competencias le capacitaron para el puesto.","en":"His skills qualified him for the job.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/705617","words":[{"g":"his, her, its, their"},null,{"g":"him / her"},null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"put"}]},{"text":"La competencia es ardua.","en":"The competition is fierce.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/519456","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"very difficult","l":"arduo"}]},{"text":"La competencia puede ocasionar fatiga.","en":"Competition can cause fatigue.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/508915","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to cause"},{"g":"fatigue"}]},{"text":"La competencia en sí misma no es mala.","en":"Competition is not bad in itself.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"yes"},{"g":"same","l":"mismo"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"suitcase"}]}]}